       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SWAP-NUMBERS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FIRST-NUM PIC 9(5).
       01 SECOND-NUM PIC 9(5).
       01 TEMP-VALUE PIC 9(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "Enter first number: " WITH NO ADVANCING. ACCEPT FIRST-NUM.
           DISPLAY "Enter second number: " WITH NO ADVANCING. ACCEPT SECOND-NUM.
           MOVE FIRST-NUM TO TEMP-VALUE.
           MOVE SECOND-NUM TO FIRST-NUM.
           MOVE TEMP-VALUE TO SECOND-NUM.
           DISPLAY "After swap: " FIRST-NUM " " SECOND-NUM.
           STOP RUN.
